+.. change::
+    :tags: bug, sql
+    :tickets: 5717
+
+    Fixed issue where a :class:`.RemovedIn20Warning` would erroneously emit
+    when the ``.bind`` attribute were accessed internally on objects,
+    particularly when stringifying a SQL construct.
